      "value": "We need this desperately. I have avatars with animated objects that have five or six animators stacked up just so I can have that object be able to do three or four different animations. Its a pain in the ass to set up, and tends to be very glitchy. However, most people just straight up duplicate the entire mesh they want to animate for each animation which is not so good for optimization and network traffic.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
